{"3950440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lootbane", "steam_appid": 3950440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lootbane</strong> is a minimalistic ARPG set in a world where loot is power, and risk is everything. Every turn brings a new encounter: peaceful grasslands, harsh steppes, volcanic wastelands, and deeper dungeons hiding rare gear and darker choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/faebd65f3068798bec9c0fdacb894118.poster.avif?t=1783941080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/faebd65f3068798bec9c0fdacb894118.webm?t=1783941080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/faebd65f3068798bec9c0fdacb894118.mp4?t=1783941080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple rules. Endless choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items are randomized, and their true power remains unknown until you extract them from a dungeon or win a fight. Every decision you make - whether to explore further, stand and fight, or retreat - turns into a high-stakes gamble where a single greedy move can cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/9f91f459ef066905b435b70bf940a288.poster.avif?t=1783941080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/9f91f459ef066905b435b70bf940a288.webm?t=1783941080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/9f91f459ef066905b435b70bf940a288.mp4?t=1783941080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic auto-battler</strong> - fights resolve automatically, but your build choices, equipment merges, and abilities create deep, game-breaking synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ abilities</strong> - mix and match to discover explosive interactions and combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized loot &amp; crafting</strong> - every run feels new: merge items, craft upgrades, and adapt on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple heroes</strong> - four distinct starters (Warrior, Vampire, Wizard, Ranger) with different stats/abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Followers &amp; choices</strong> - recruit companions with passive perks and active abilities, choose who comes along.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 unique zones</strong> - each with its own monsters, encounters, and mini-bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom difficulty</strong> - 1 life (hardcore), 3 lives (balanced), or unlimited lives (casual).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-progression</strong> - unlock 30+ permanent starting bonuses to expand replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite replayability</strong> - procedural encounters, randomized items, and countless synergies mean no two runs feel the same.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lootbane</strong> is a minimalistic ARPG set in a world where loot is power, and risk is everything. Every turn brings a new encounter: peaceful grasslands, harsh steppes, volcanic wastelands, and deeper dungeons hiding rare gear and darker choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/faebd65f3068798bec9c0fdacb894118.poster.avif?t=1783941080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/faebd65f3068798bec9c0fdacb894118.webm?t=1783941080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/faebd65f3068798bec9c0fdacb894118.mp4?t=1783941080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple rules. Endless choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items are randomized, and their true power remains unknown until you extract them from a dungeon or win a fight. Every decision you make - whether to explore further, stand and fight, or retreat - turns into a high-stakes gamble where a single greedy move can cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/9f91f459ef066905b435b70bf940a288.poster.avif?t=1783941080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/9f91f459ef066905b435b70bf940a288.webm?t=1783941080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/9f91f459ef066905b435b70bf940a288.mp4?t=1783941080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic auto-battler</strong> - fights resolve automatically, but your build choices, equipment merges, and abilities create deep, game-breaking synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ abilities</strong> - mix and match to discover explosive interactions and combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized loot &amp; crafting</strong> - every run feels new: merge items, craft upgrades, and adapt on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple heroes</strong> - four distinct starters (Warrior, Vampire, Wizard, Ranger) with different stats/abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Followers &amp; choices</strong> - recruit companions with passive perks and active abilities, choose who comes along.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 unique zones</strong> - each with its own monsters, encounters, and mini-bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom difficulty</strong> - 1 life (hardcore), 3 lives (balanced), or unlimited lives (casual).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-progression</strong> - unlock 30+ permanent starting bonuses to expand replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite replayability</strong> - procedural encounters, randomized items, and countless synergies mean no two runs feel the same.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Lootbane is a minimalistic ARPG of risk and reward where insatiable greed drives every decision. Explore shifting regions, build synergistic warbands, and descend into dangerous dungeons for legendary loot", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“A Deeply Addictive New Dungeon Crawling Roguelike!”<br>Splattercatgaming<br><br>“...it's exactly the sort of fast-paced risk/reward decision making I've been craving.&quot; Just remember: &quot;Loot is power, and risk is everything.&quot;”<br>PCGamesN<br>